    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d27">

                <pb facs="0124" n="878" sameAs="frus:frus1917Supp02v02/pg878"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 600.119/101</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Minister in Sweden</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Morris</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-06-11T18:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 11, 1917, 6 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>232. Your 402, June 4, 2 p.m.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d27-f1"/> You should not
                    attend joint meetings of Allied Ministers for the present but secure informally
                    all information disclosed at such meetings, advising Department thereof.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
